# Local dogfooding probes (ZBOOK_Github); not part of the product
.dogfood/

# Visual goldens are LINUX only, because CI is ubuntu and a golden is only
# comparable against the renderer that recorded it. Running `tests/visual` on
# Windows or macOS makes Playwright WRITE a `-visual-win32.png` /
# `-visual-darwin.png` beside the real one and fail -- committing those would
# add dead files that never match CI. Ignore them so a local run cannot leak.
tests/visual/*-snapshots/*-visual-win32.png
tests/visual/*-snapshots/*-visual-darwin.png
